WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:05.279
The Star Wars saga has become a sprawling
epic, spanning numerous planets, alien races,

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.740
and massive cosmic battles.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.760
In fact, there's so much stuff happening that
sometimes it's hard to keep it all straight.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.000
And that's why we're here to explain the entire
Star Wars story.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.300
The Star Wars story begins during a period
of relative peace in the galaxy.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.560
A thousand years before the events of the
Skywalker Saga, the Jedi Order defeated the

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.340
Sith Order, seemingly for good.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.460
While the Jedi became the keepers of peace
in the Galactic Republic, the surviving Sith

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.529
secretly began plotting to overthrow them.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:34.520
It was near the end of this millennium of
peace that Darth Sidious, a Sith Lord who

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:39.370
was secretly Senator Sheev Palpatine of Naboo,
set in motion his plan to eradicate the Jedi

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.560
and seize control of the Republic's government.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:46.820
As part of his plan for galactic domination,
Sidious acted as a secret advisor to the Trade

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:50.340
Federation, ordering them to blockade and
ultimately invade Naboo.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:54.960
Once the Trade Federation arrived on the planet,
Sidious slipped back into his Senator Palpatine

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:59.760
disguise and advised Naboo's queen, Padme
Amidala, that the current chancellor of the

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:01.560
Republic wasn't acting in their best interests.

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:05.820
Working with his his Sith apprentice, Darth
Maul, Sidious was able to manipulate and manufacture

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:08.020
tensions in the Republic from both sides.

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:12.820
Meanwhile, on a mission to protect Amidala,
two Jedi Knights, Master Qui-Gon Jinn and

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:17.509
his apprentice, Obi-Wan Kenobi, happened upon
a young Anakin Skywalker while repairing their

00:01:17.509 --> 00:01:18.620
ship on Tatooine.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:23.220
Qui-Gon discovered potentially unprecedented
levels of Force sensitivity in the boy.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:28.640
After taking Anakin with them, Qui-Gon urged
the Jedi Council to train Anakin, but the

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:29.160
Jedi were reluctant.

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:33.860
After Qui-Gon's death at the hands of Darth
Maul, the Council accepted Anakin as Obi-Wan's

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:34.680
new apprentice.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:39.759
Palpatine was elected chancellor at Amidala's
urging, granting him a place of unprecedented

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:41.240
power to further his plans.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:45.560
Following the events of The Phantom Menace,
tensions within the Republic continued to

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:47.420
rise under Palpatine's leadership.

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:51.780
Anakin Skywalker grew into a young Jedi Knight
of considerable Force talents.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:56.940
And finally, Darth Sidious took on a new apprentice,
former Jedi Count Dooku, who adopted the Sith

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:58.120
name "Darth Tyranus."

00:01:58.580 --> 00:02:03.240
Dooku, at Sidious' urging, created tension
in the Republic by forming the Separatists.

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:08.720
As numerous star systems threatened secession,
now-Senator Padme Amidala fought to keep the

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:11.240
Republic together, and was nearly assassinated
for her trouble.

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:15.640
Obi-Wan was dispatched by the Jedi Council
to find out who was behind the attempt on

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:17.900
her life, while Anakin stayed behind as her
bodyguard.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:19.800
"What about Senator Amidala?

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.020
She will still need protecting."

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:24.940
"Handle that, your padawan will."

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:27.300
"Anakin."

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:32.080
Obi-Wan's investigation uncovered an army
of clones, seemingly ordered for the Republic

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:33.460
by a dead Jedi Knight.

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:38.160
This discovery led Obi-Wan to discover a Separatist
gathering on the planet Geonosis.

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:42.660
Back on the Republic capital of Coruscant,
Chancellor Palpatine was granted emergency

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:46.840
powers to use the newly discovered clones
in the fight against the Separatists, launching

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:47.940
the Clone Wars.

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:52.860
During this time, Anakin and Padme fell in
love, and Anakin's internal anger grew as

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.980
he discovered the death of his mother on Tatooine.

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:59.600
The Clone Wars raged for three years, with
Dooku as the figurehead of the Separatist

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:03.440
movement and Palpatine as the increasingly
powerful chancellor of the Republic.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:08.760
The war raged across the galaxy, consuming
system after system as everyone picked sides.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:13.420
The Jedi Order were tasked with joining the
conflict as generals of the clone armies discovered

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:15.380
during Star Wars: Attack of the Clones.

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:20.220
As the conflict raged, Padme remained a force
in the Senate, working for unity while mistakenly

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.880
believing she could trust Palpatine.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:26.540
Obi-Wan and Anakin fought on the front lines,
and Anakin even took on a Jedi apprentice

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:27.900
named Ahsoka Tano.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:32.220
During this time, he and Padme fell deeper
in love, and they married in secret.

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:35.440
However, as the war went on, Anakin's darker
tendencies grew.

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:40.460
Ready for the final stage of his plan, Palpatine
allowed himself to be taken prisoner by Separatist

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.480
General Grievous.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:45.780
This kickstarted a rescue mission, leading
Obi-Wan and Anakin to infiltrate Grievous'

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.280
ship to rescue Palpatine.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:51.920
Once inside, they found Dooku, and in the
battle with the Sith, Anakin killed the Separatist

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.400
leader at Palpatine's behest.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:57.860
With Palpatine rescued, the Republic pressed
their advantage in the war, and Yoda and Obi-Wan

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:01.560
were both sent to the front lines in an effort
to finish the conflict once and for all.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:06.460
Back on Coruscant, Padme told Anakin that
she was pregnant, and his dreams became troubled

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:08.840
by visions of his wife dying in childbirth.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:13.220
Anakin grew even closer to Palpatine, especially
after the chancellor hinted he might have

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:16.960
knowledge that could prevent Padme from dying
during childbirth...or ever.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:22.420
"Did you ever hear the tragedy of Darth Plagueis
the Wise?"

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:27.740
To push his plan into its final stages, Sidious
revealed himself as a Sith Lord to Anakin,

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:30.100
while also promising him knowledge of the
Dark Side.

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:34.380
Anakin reported Sidious to Mace Windu, who
attempted to arrest the Sith Lord.

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:38.860
During the battle, Anakin chose to save the
Sith, all in the hopes that Sidious could

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:40.040
save Padme's life.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:45.060
With Mace Windu dead, Anakin pledged himself
to the service of Darth Sidious in the hopes

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:46.600
he could prevent Padme's death.

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:50.980
Sidious dubbed his new enforcer "Darth Vader,"
and then ordered him to slaughter everybody

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:52.420
inside the Jedi Temple.

00:04:52.780 --> 00:04:58.180
This began the Great Jedi Purge under Sidious'
Order 66, which required all clone troopers

00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:00.520
to terminate their Jedi generals on sight.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:05.060
Only a handful of Jedi, like Obi-Wan and Yoda,
were able to fend off their attackers.

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:09.710
Meanwhile in the Senate, Palpatine used his
power to declare the Jedi outlaws, and turned

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:11.460
the Republic into the Galactic Empire.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:16.380
To end his self-orchestrated war, Sidious
sent Vader to the planet Mustafar to kill

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:19.120
the remaining Separatist leaders and shut
down the clone army.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.640
Then, Obi-Wan and Yoda made their move.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:26.580
Obi-Wan went to fight Vader on Mustafar while
Yoda confronted Sidious on Coruscant.

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:30.300
Unfortunately, Padme reached Vader first,
and when she tried to convince him to see

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.860
the error of his ways, he nearly choked her
to death.

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:37.300
By the end of Revenge of the Sith, Sidious
fought Yoda to a stalemate, while Obi-Wan

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:39.020
defeated Vader and left him to die.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:44.420
After facing the Sith, Obi-Wan and Yoda regrouped
with Senator Bail Organa of Alderaan.

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:48.639
Clinging to life after her husband nearly
killed her, Padme gave birth to twins named

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:52.520
Luke and Leia before passing away, leaving
the children effectively orphaned.

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:57.540
Leia was adopted by Organa and his wife, while
Luke was sent to Tatooine to live with Schmi

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.620
Skywalker's relatives, the Lars family.

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:04.510
Obi-Wan moved to Tatooine to keep watch over
Luke, while Yoda moved to the swamps of Dagobah

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:05.680
to live in solitude.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:11.020
In the absence of the Jedi, Emperor Palpatine
quickly consolidated his vast power with Vader

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:11.880
by his side.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:16.300
However, even as he celebrated his victory,
a small group of leaders were already sowing

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:17.300
the seeds of rebellion.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:22.280
One soon-to-be rebel leader was Han Solo,
a Corellian orphan living on the streets and

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:23.800
working for a local crime lord.

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:28.379
When he failed to escape the planet with his
girlfriend, Qi'ra, Han enlisted in the Imperial

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:28.880
Navy.

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:32.620
After three years, Han deserted and joined
up with an outlaw named Beckett to earn a

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.320
new life for himself as a pilot.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:38.639
His journey led him to reunite with Qi'ra,
now a trusted lieutenant in the Crimson Dawn

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:39.580
crime syndicate.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:44.349
Together they embarked on a journey to steal
a valuable shipment of coaxium fuel for Crimson

00:06:44.349 --> 00:06:46.060
Dawn boss, Dryden Vos.

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:50.780
Along the way, Solo met his best friend, Chewbacca,
and obtained his trademark ship, the Millennium

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:51.280
Falcon.

00:06:51.909 --> 00:06:55.720
At the end of the adventure, Qi'ra chose to
betray and leave Han, leaving Han to work

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.140
as a smuggler for the next decade.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:02.180
In the years after the Great Jedi Purge, the
empire tried to exterminate any former jedi

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:03.040
still in hiding.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:07.480
Meanwhile, a small band of resistance leaders
grew more and more organized, and the Rebel

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:09.080
Alliance began to take root.

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:14.000
Nearly two decades after the fall of the Jedi,
there was a breakthrough thanks to Galen Erso,

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.820
a Rebel sympathizer who'd been forced to work
on the Death Star.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:21.120
Erso planted a key flaw in the Death Star
that would allow the Rebels to destroy it.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:26.220
During an all-out battle at Scarif, Jyn Erso
and Captain Cassian Andor gave their lives

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:27.760
to steal the Death Star plans.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:32.360
Nearly 20 years passed between the end of
the Clone Wars and the Battle of Scarif, and

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:37.000
during that time, Leia Organa and Luke Skywalker
had grown up on their adoptive homeworlds.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:41.080
Leia, now princess of Alderaan, was a key
member of the Alliance and managed to flee

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.980
Scarif with the Death Star plans.

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:47.639
When she was captured by Vader, she hid the
plans in R2-D2, who escaped to Tatooine in

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:49.740
a pod with his counterpart, C-3PO.

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:54.160
On Tatooine, the plans fell into the hands
of Luke, a farm boy with dreams of being a

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.000
Rebel pilot.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:08:00.040
After viewing a message from Leia directed
at Obi-Wan Kenobi, he sought out the old man,

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:03.280
and when the two met up, Obi-Wan revealed
he was once a Jedi Knight.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:07.830
Determined to get the plans to Alderaan, Luke
and Obi-Wan booked passage aboard Han Solo's

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:08.780
Millennium Falcon.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.460
Unfortunately, Alderaan had been obliterated,
courtesy of the Death Star.

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:17.520
After our heroes found Alderaan destroyed,
the Millennium Falcon was pulled into the

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:21.580
Death Star's tractor beam, giving Luke, Han,
and Chewbacca the opportunity to search for

00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:24.200
Leia, while Obi-Wan disabled the station's
tractor beam.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:28.820
A battle broke out as Luke, Han, Chewie, and
Leia shot their way out of the station, while

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.720
Obi-Wan dueled Vader in a long-awaited rematch.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:34.400
Sadly, the Sith Lord killed Obi-Wan in front
of Luke.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:39.440
Back at the Rebel base on Yavin IV, the Alliance
formed a plan to assault the Death Star.

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:43.440
Luke volunteered to join the fight, while
Han left with the reward money he earned rescuing

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:44.120
the princess.

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:47.860
At the last moment, Han returned to help in
the battle, shooting Vader out of the sky

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:50.220
and leaving Luke free to destroy the Death
Star.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:54.290
With the help of the Force, Luke saved the
Rebel base and handed the Empire its biggest

00:08:54.290 --> 00:08:55.120
defeat yet.

00:08:55.660 --> 00:09:00.040
Three years later, Vader finally located the
Alliance base on Hoth and launched a full-scale

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.960
assault, prompting a Rebel evacuation.

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:07.839
Han, Leia, Chewie and C-3PO fled in the Falcon,
while Luke left with R2-D2 in his X-Wing to

00:09:07.840 --> 00:09:10.020
seek Jedi training from Yoda on Dagobah.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:14.360
The Falcon made its way to the gas planet
of Bespin, where Solo met his old friend,

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:18.500
Lando Calrissian...who unwillingly gave the
Falcon and her crew up to Vader.

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:22.740
Luke, sensing his friends were in danger,
went to Bespin against Yoda's wishes to save

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:23.240
them.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:27.500
After the bounty hunter Boba Fett froze Han
Solo in carbonite to take him to Jabba the

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.200
Hutt, Vader and Luke fought in a lightsaber
duel.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:34.040
During the fight, Vader cut off Luke's hand
and revealed that he was his father.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:38.680
Devastated and heartbroken, Luke leapt away
from Vader rather than join the Dark Side,

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.660
but fortunately, he was rescued by Leia, Lando,
and Chewie.

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:45.280
Months passed as the team developed a plot
to rescue Han.

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:49.930
Both Leia and Lando infiltrated Jabba the
Hutt's palace while in disguise, but Leia

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:52.560
was captured after getting Han Solo out of
the carbonite.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:57.540
Luke sent C-3PO and R2-D2 ahead as "gifts"
for Jabba, before entering himself.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:02.140
Jabba managed to capture Luke, and tried to
have both Luke and Han executed by throwing

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:03.520
them into a Sarlacc pit.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:08.040
Luckily, Luke had hidden his new lightsaber
in R2-D2's body, and with the help of Han,

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.910
Chewie, and Lando, Luke destroyed Jabba's
bodyguards.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.220
Meanwhile, Leia strangled the giant worm with
her own chains.

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:18.160
After rescuing Han, Luke returned to Dagobah
to find Yoda dying.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:23.180
After Yoda's passing, Obi-Wan's Force ghost
informed Luke that Leia was his sister.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:27.240
Determined to complete his training and restore
the Jedi, Luke returned to his friends.

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:31.000
But in the midst of the war, the Empire had
constructed a second Death Star.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:35.720
The second Death Star was fitted with a shield
around its entire exterior, generated by a

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:38.340
satellite dish located on the forest moon
of Endor.

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:42.780
The Rebel strike included a covert attack
to destroy this shield generator, along with

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:46.940
a full-scale fleet assault to destroy the
Death Star itself once the shield was down.

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:51.839
Luke, Han, Leia, and Chewie led the Endor
team, while Lando, Admiral Ackbar, and Wedge

00:10:51.840 --> 00:10:53.480
Antilles led the fleet strike.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:57.760
Meanwhile, Luke turned himself in to Vader
so he could face his father alone on the Death

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:58.260
Star.

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:02.300
As their battle commenced, Vader brought Luke
before the Emperor, who attempted to convert

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.180
the young Jedi.

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:06.260
Luke resisted Palpatine's control and fought
against Vader.

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:10.940
However, after realizing he was becoming just
like his dad, Luke refused to kill Vader.

00:11:11.460 --> 00:11:15.560
Enraged by this, the Emperor tortured Luke
with Force lightning, which led Vader to pick

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:18.480
up his master and throw him into the station's
reactor core.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:23.220
On Endor, Han and Leia destroyed the shield
generator with help from the native Ewoks,

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:26.779
and the Rebel fleet completed its mission,
destroying the Death Star and effectively

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:28.280
ending the Galactic Empire.

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:32.920
As the New Galactic Republic began to form
with help from major Rebel Alliance figures

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:37.040
like Leia and Mon Mothma, the remains of the
Empire retreated to the Outer Rim.

00:11:37.280 --> 00:11:40.800
There, they fell under the command of a mysterious
Force user named Snoke.

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:44.060
The ashes of the Empire then gave birth to
the First Order.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:48.940
Meanwhile, Han and Leia had a son, Ben Solo,
who showed the Force prowess of the Skywalker

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:49.440
bloodline.

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:53.840
Luke made good on his promise to rebuild the
Jedi and started a temple where Ben was a

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:54.340
student.

00:11:54.620 --> 00:11:59.180
Unfortunately, Snoke began to influence Ben,
and the young Jedi turned on Luke, converting

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:01.200
some students and slaughtering others.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.220
Heartbroken, Luke went into exile.

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:07.320
Sensing the threat of Snoke and the First
Order, Leia formed an underground movement

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:10.320
separate from the Republic, a group known
as the Resistance.

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:15.210
With his military commander, General Armitage
Hux, Snoke developed a massive system-killing

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:17.160
weapon known as Starkiller Base.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:21.400
Meanwhile, Ben Solo, now known as Kylo Ren,
sought to find Luke Skywalker.

00:12:21.740 --> 00:12:25.900
Skywalker's location was hidden on a piece
of starmap obtained by Resistance pilot Poe

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:28.200
Dameron and hidden in his droid BB-8.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:31.960
The droid was ultimately found by a Jakku
scavenger named Rey.

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:36.139
Together with a First Order deserter named
Finn, Rey stole the long-dormant Millennium

00:12:36.140 --> 00:12:39.900
Falcon and left Jakku, only to run into Han
Solo and Chewbacca.

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:44.470
While stopping off at the planet Takodana,
Rey discovered Luke's original lightsaber,

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:46.440
before getting kidnapped by Kylo Ren.

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:50.940
With Han and Chewie's help, Finn was able
to return Luke's map to Leia and the Resistance.

00:12:51.380 --> 00:12:56.040
General Leia Organa and the Resistance launched
a desperate attack to destroy Starkiller Base,

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:58.780
while Finn, Han Solo, and Chewbacca tried
to rescue Rey.

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:01.180
While there, Han confronted his son, Ben.

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:05.940
Hoping to prove to Snoke that he'd truly turned
to the Dark Side, Kylo Ren murdered his father.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:10.740
Up on the surface of the base's planet, Rey
took up Luke's lightsaber and defeated Kylo

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:12.900
Ren with her newly-discovered force powers.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:17.600
After the battle, Rey journeyed with R2-D2
and Chewbacca to a remote island on the planet

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.170
Ahch-To, prepared to ask Luke for guidance.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:24.950
Following Starkiller Base's destruction, the
First Order sent a fleet to the Resistance

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:25.940
base on D'Qar.

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:30.640
Poe Dameron led a massive attack on the First
Order fleet against Leia's wishes, losing

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:33.300
most of the resistance's fleet in the process.

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:37.420
While the Resistance fled, Rey found Luke
was unwilling to offer her any assistance.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:41.800
Rey was ultimately able to convince Luke to
help her, but Rey began sharing secret, Force-connected

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.500
conversations with Kylo Ren.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:47.580
Ultimately, Luke and Rey had a falling out
when she tried to convince him that Kylo was

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:48.920
capable of redemption.

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:53.240
Rey fled the island, while Force Ghost Yoda
burned down the first Jedi Temple with ghost

00:13:53.240 --> 00:13:53.740
lightning.

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:58.779
Leia and Vice Admiral Holdo staged a last-ditch
effort to save the Resistance from the approaching

00:13:58.780 --> 00:13:59.400
First Order.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:04.019
On Snoke's flagship, Rey allowed herself to
be captured so she could try to convert Kylo,

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:05.600
who initially seemed to be on her side.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:09.900
Rather than watch Rey die, Kylo betrayed his
former master, and killed Snoke.

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:14.840
But after fighting Snoke's guards together,
Kylo asked Rey to join him in ruling the galaxy.

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.480
"The jedi, the rebels.

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:17.980
Let it all die.

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:23.160
Rey, I want you to join me."

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:26.360
Rey declined and fled to the Resistance on
Crait.

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:31.020
After Vice Admiral Holdo flew the Resistance
flagship into the First Order fleet, crippling

00:14:31.029 --> 00:14:35.831
their starships, new Supreme Leader Kylo Ren
led a ground assault on the last of the Resistance

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:36.540
on Crait.

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:40.830
There, Luke faced down the First Order assault
and bought the Resistance time to escape on

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:41.920
the Millennium Falcon.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:46.440
However, the Luke on Crait was a Force projection,
while the real Skywalker was still back on

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:46.960
Ahch-To.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:51.830
The strain of projecting his consciousness
across the galaxy was too much, and while

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:55.140
the Resistance lived to fight on, Luke became
one with the Force.

00:14:55.840 --> 00:15:00.100
As Rey trained with Leia to further develop
her Jedi abilities, the resistance discovered

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:01.720
that Emperor Palpatine had returned.

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:06.480
Palpatine made Kylo Ren an offer: Kylo could
rule the galaxy as a new Emperor with the

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:10.120
help of a long-hidden fleet of planet killers
if he agreed to kill Rey.

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:14.220
Meanwhile the Resistance went in search of
a Sith Wayfinder which could point the way

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:16.920
to Palpatine and stop his fleet before it
launched.

00:15:17.320 --> 00:15:21.180
As her anxiety built during the mission, Rey
discovered a new layer of darkness in her.

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:25.720
Rey's anxieties over who she was built to
a peak when Kylo Ren told her that he knew

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:29.760
her true heritage: She was the granddaughter
of Palpatine himself.

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:34.220
After learning the truth, Rey nearly killed
Kylo in battle, but healed him after Leia

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:36.600
intervened to save her son with her dying
breath.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:41.360
Luke's spirit urged Rey not to give up, and
Rey journeyed to Exegol to confront Palpatine.

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:46.540
There, the revived Emperor revealed his true
plan: To convert her to become the new Empress

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:51.160
and leader of the Sith. Rey refused his offer
and fought Palpatine with the help of a redeemed

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:51.860
Kylo Ren.

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:56.300
In the end, both the Emperor and the fleet
were defeated, and the galaxy was saved.

00:15:56.620 --> 00:16:00.360
In the aftermath of the battle, Rey forged
her own lightsaber and buried those of her

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:02.260
teachers in the Tatooine desert.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:06.320
Finally, she revealed that she had taken a
new name: Rey Skywalker.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:08.620
"Again, it's like poetry, sort of, they rhyme.

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:11.620
Every stanza kinda rhymes with the last one."

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.620
Check out one of our newest videos right here!

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:17.940
Plus, even more Looper videos about your favorite
movies are coming soon.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:21.660
Subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit the
bell so you don't miss a single one.

